# Minecraft Version(s): 26.3
## Changes:

## Fixes:
- Flaming Aura not being obtainable
- Curse of Undying not being obtainable and not counting as a curse
- Ghost Spirit being obtainable from Enchanting Tables, random loot and mob/trade equipment instead of only as a treasure enchantment like the other Wolf spirits
- Bear Spirit and Boar Spirit being combinable
- Scorpion Spirit poisoning and withering the Wolf itself instead of its target
- Ominous Rain only dropping a single projectile instead of 9
- Implosion being incompatible with Quick Charge but compatible with Bomber and Flare
- Evokers Wrath being compatible with Bomber and Flare
- Several wrong infos in the in-game wiki (loot sources, incompatibilities, applicable items and the max level of Rejuvenation)
